                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The pull-request description now links the accessibility report and explains keyboard behavior. I have attached the final text for review. The patch itself is unchanged.\\n\\nThe description identifies the keyboard shortcut, arrow-key navigation, empty-result behavior and focus restoration after Escape. It links the interaction map and the checks Eli recorded against 8d31c4a.\\n\\nBecause the description changed from v1 to v2, the earlier request is stale. I have issued a new request for the patch and description v2 together. No pull request has been created.\\n\\nPlease inspect both artifacts before deciding. Accepting authorizes creation of this pull request only; merging, publishing a release and deployment remain outside the request. If you want wording changed, send the correction and I will attach a new revision for review.",
